; WHP-Drivers Radeon HD 6410D - Windows 95 RTM INF research skeleton.
; STATUS: DELIBERATELY NON-INSTALLABLE. DO NOT COPY TO WINDOWS\INF.
; No Radeon Win16 .DRV, mini-VDD .VXD, modesetting, or DVI driver exists yet.
; Known candidates, NOT confirmed on the user's machine:
;   Desktop Sumo2:  PCI\VEN_1002&DEV_9644
;   Mobility Sumo2: PCI\VEN_1002&DEV_9645
; These comments are evidence notes, NOT enabled hardware matches.
; Activate only after read-only PCI/subsystem confirmation, validated
; display/mini-VDD binaries, INF registry review, and Win95 RTM VM tests.
; Reference: Windows 95 DDK INF syntax; VMDisp9x Windows 9x display INF.
; This file must never replace or modify VGA.DRV.

[Version]
Signature="$CHICAGO$"
Class=Display
Provider=%WHP%

[Manufacturer]
%WHP%=WHP.RadeonModels

[WHP.RadeonModels]
; Intentionally empty: no PCI binding, software fallback, or install section.
; Adding a device entry here requires a corresponding audited DDInstall
; section and real, tested Windows 95 RTM .DRV and .VXD artifacts.

[Strings]
WHP="WHP-Drivers (research only)"
Radeon6410D="AMD Radeon HD 6410D (prototype, not installable)"
